    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d717">

                <pb facs="0694" n="528" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg528"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Swenson to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1902-05-02T19:05:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 2, 1902, 7:05 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s memorandum Committee on Foreign Relations referred to in Brun’s note
                    to you April eighteenth may cause rejection treaty. Cable explanation that will
                    remove Danish Government objections, if possible.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Swenson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
